            "value": "",
            "frametrail:name": "Also to Turkey and Egypt",
            "frametrail:attributes": {
                "title": "Also to Turkey and Egypt",
                "text": "&lt;p&gt;Evidence of deliveries to other countries too. Trading shipments from occupied Crimea violates sanctions of the United States, the European Union and the United Kingdom.&lt;/p&gt;"
